# fastgrep

[![CI](https://github.com/example/fastgrep/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/example/fastgrep/actions)

A tiny, fast grep clone.

## Install

```sh
cargo install fastgrep
```

## Usage

1. Build the index: `fastgrep index .`
2. Search: `fastgrep find "needle"`

## Features

* Regex support
* Respects `.gitignore`
  * including nested ignore files

